ntent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The cap is asked early and answers last.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" The rule is world scope, so","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"it runs at stage 1, ahead of the game’s own location and item rules and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ahead of ","type":"text"},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" itself. Not ahead of everything the game writes: the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"bootstrap files a game’s own rules before any module’s, so a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"world.before(.take)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the game declares is asked before the cap is.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Stage 1 is what holds the cap for a game that replaces the verb with an"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"action(.take)"},{"text":" of its own, and what stops a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"before(.take)"},{"text":" rule that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes the world from committing its change and then being told the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"player’s hands are full. A cap refusal also unwinds before the room’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"beforeEachTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" upkeep runs, which is what a stage-1 refusal has always","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"done.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Running first would make “no room in your hands” answer for every refusal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"text":" owns, which is the broad line printed over the specific one. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rule consults ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"take"},{"text":"‘s own ladder before it speaks, and says nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whenever ","type":"text"},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has a more particular answer: taking yourself, taking a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"person, taking what you already hold or wear, taking scenery, taking what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you cannot reach, taking the vehicle you are standing in. An order given to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"somebody else is not weighed at all — the cap is about the player’s hands.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A refusal the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"game","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" writes in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"before(.take)"},{"type":"text","text":" rule of its own is stage 3"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and so is printed only if the cap passed. Put it in a "},{"code":"reach { … }","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"have it answer first.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Weight already in the player’s hands is not weighed twice. Taking something","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out of a sack they are carrying does not change the load, so the cap has no","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"opinion about it however full the sack is."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Item\/burden","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Player\/burden","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" weigh the way the cap weighs, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s own load gates — a crack too narrow for a coffin, a rope that holds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"for fe